<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Assign the macro, walk n run the macro

Requirements :
- Minimum 60FPS (Reduce the graphic setting for better experience)
- Stable internet connection (Yellow ping still possible for running this macro)
- Almost all of 5 star bow character can use this macro, you just need to adjust the delay between characters
- You can also use 4 star bow character like Fischl, Amber (C1 would be good), Gorou, Kujou Sara .But you need more adjustment 

Tested with Amber C1</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 21 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 30 ms
LeftDown 1
LeftUp 1
Delay 17 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Genshin Impact</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>